<title>USA: Muni bond sales total $2.7 bln for next week.</title>
<headline>Muni bond sales total $2.7 bln for next week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive and negotiated municipal bond sales for next week are expected to total $2.7 billion in 86 offerings, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>Competitive sales total $886 million in 48 sales. The largest is a $250 million Illinois deal on Thursday.</p>
<p>Negotiated sales total $1.8 billion in 38 offerings. The largest is a $264 million Harris County Health Facilities Developemental Authority, Texas, issue through Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
</text>
